  note: "Each balance entry is a separate sub-account. `amount` is a decimal string in `balance_currency` with `decimals` decimals; `amount_base` is the same value in base units (cents, satoshis). `equivalent_in_product_currency` is the same amount converted to `product_currency` for comparison with package prices. Multi-balance payments (combining sub-accounts) are not supported yet — each purchase debits a single sub-account. When paying with payment_method=\"balance\", pass balance_currency to pick the sub-account."